      "designator": "CS23-0",
      "grouping_at_time": "Subpart E \u2014 Powerplant",
      "title_at_revision": "Propeller speed and pitch controls",
      "text": "(a) If there are propeller speed or pitch controls, they must be grouped and arranged to allow \u2013\n  (1) Separate control of each propeller; and\n  (2) Simultaneous control of all propellers.\n(b) The controls must allow ready synchronisation of all propellers on twin-engine aeroplanes.",
